"{    \"translations\": [        {            \"english_version\": \"Trump's former criminal defense lawyer has become the top law enforcement official in the country. Some Republicans were against this decision, but it still went through.\",            \"english_title\": \"Trump's Lawyer Becomes Top Official\",            \"translated_version\": \"El ex abogado defensor de Trump se ha convertido en el principal oficial de la ley en el pa\u00eds. Algunos republicanos estaban en contra de esta decisi\u00f3n, pero a\u00fan as\u00ed se aprob\u00f3.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Abogado de Trump es el Jefe\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Russia continued its attacks on Ukraine. President Zelensky said Ukraine is running low on missile interceptors.\",            \"english_title\": \"Russia Attacks Ukraine\",            \"translated_version\": \"Rusia continu\u00f3 sus ataques a Ucrania. El presidente Zelensky dijo que Ucrania tiene pocos interceptores de misiles.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Rusia Ataca a Ucrania\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"In Kosovo, a lawmaker threw eggs at the acting prime minister during a session. Police had to step in to handle the situation.\",            \"english_title\": \"Eggs Thrown in Kosovo\",            \"translated_version\": \"En Kosovo, un legislador lanz\u00f3 huevos al primer ministro en funciones durante una sesi\u00f3n. La polic\u00eda tuvo que intervenir para manejar la situaci\u00f3n.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Huevos Lanzados en Kosovo\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"Italy has started border controls because many migrants, about 78,000, have come from Morocco to the Spanish area of Ceuta.\",            \"english_title\": \"Italy Starts Border Controls\",            \"translated_version\": \"Italia ha comenzado controles fronterizos porque muchos migrantes, alrededor de 78,000, han venido de Marruecos al \u00e1rea espa\u00f1ola de Ceuta.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Italia Controla Fronteras\"        },        {            \"english_version\": \"A wildfire in British Columbia is still not under control. It has spread over a large area, about 36 square miles.\",            \"english_title\": \"Wildfire in British Columbia\",            \"translated_version\": \"Un incendio forestal en Columbia Brit\u00e1nica a\u00fan no est\u00e1 bajo control. Se ha extendido por un \u00e1rea grande, alrededor de 36 millas cuadradas.\",            \"translated_title\": \"Incendio en Columbia Brit\u00e1nica\"        }    ]}"